GRF / V-TS / V-STAT\n-"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" 黄金测试集：2021C、2022C、2023C、**2026A**\n- 反幻觉：`data_contract.json` + `verify.py`；机理题再加 `run_manifest.json"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`\n- 论文：摘要最后写、假设编号闭环、评委黑白打印用灰阶图"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"完整目录、脚本和 references 索引见 `cumcm/SKILL.md`。版本记录见 `CHANGELOG.md`。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 许可与贡献"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"使用与二次开发请保留来源。问题与 PR 见 `CONTRIBUTING.md`。"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
